# Runtime files the binary creates in its working directory. A maintainer who
# runs a reachable server from the repo root gets an audit trail whether or not
# they asked for one, and a relay started with --tls-self-signed writes a
# certificate and its private key. One of these was staged by accident.
shell-tunnel-audit.jsonl
shell-tunnel-audit.jsonl.1
shell-tunnel-cert.pem
shell-tunnel-key.pem

